    "Turn your keyboard into a musical instrument.\nA few permissions are needed to get started." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwandeln Sie Ihre Tastatur in ein Musikinstrument.\nEinige Berechtigungen sind zum Starten erforderlich."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn your keyboard into a musical instrument.\nA few permissions are needed to get started."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transformez votre clavier en instrument de musique.\nQuelques autorisations sont nécessaires pour commencer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trasforma la tua tastiera in uno strumento musicale.\nSono necessarie alcune autorizzazioni per iniziare."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーボードを楽器に変えましょう。\n始めるには権限が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "키보드를 악기로 만들어 보세요.\n시작하려면 몇 가지 권한이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将键盘变成乐器。\n需要一些权限才能开始使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn your keyboard into a musical instrument.\nType to play notes, follow scores, and practice anywhere." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwandle deine Tastatur in ein Musikinstrument.\nTippe, um Noten zu spielen, Stücke zu verfolgen und überall zu üben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn your keyboard into a musical instrument.\nType to play notes, follow scores, and practice anywhere."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transformez votre clavier en instrument de musique.\nTapez pour jouer des notes, suivre des partitions et pratiquer n'importe où."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trasforma la tua tastiera in uno strumento musicale.\nDigita per suonare note, seguire partiture e praticare ovunque."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーボードを楽器に変えよう。\nキーを押して音符を演奏し、楽譜に沿って、どこでも練習できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "키보드를 악기로 변환하세요.\n키를 눌러 음을 연주하고, 악보를 따라가며 어디서든 연습하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将键盘变成乐器。\n随手一按就是音符，跟着乐谱弹奏你喜欢的曲子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type anywhere. Relax and listen\nto the sound of every keystroke." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Überall tippen. Entspanne dich und höre\ndem Klang jedes Tastendrucks zu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Type anywhere. Relax and listen\nto the sound of every keystroke."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tapez n'importe où. Détendez-vous et écoutez\nle son de chaque frappe."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Digita ovunque. Rilassati e ascolta\nil suono di ogni tasto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どこでも入力できます。すべてのキーストロークの音に\n耳を傾けてリラックスしましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "어디서나 타이핑하세요. 모든 키 입력 소리를\n들으며 릴랙스하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随处输入，聆听每一次按键的声音，\n让打字变成放松的享受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TypeNote" : {

    },
    "TypeNote needs to listen to your keystrokes\nto play sounds. Nothing is recorded or sent anywhere." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TypeNote muss deine Tastatureingaben abhören,\num Klänge abzuspielen. Es wird nichts aufgezeichnet oder gesendet."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TypeNote needs to listen to your keystrokes\nto play sounds. Nothing is recorded or sent anywhere."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TypeNote doit écouter vos frappes\npour jouer des sons. Rien n'est enregistré ni envoyé nulle part."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TypeNote deve ascoltare i tuoi tasti\nper riprodurre suoni. Nulla viene registrato o inviato."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TypeNote は音を鳴らすためにキーストロークを\n監視する必要があります。録音や送信は一切行いません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TypeNote는 소리를 재생하기 위해 키 입력을\n감지해야 합니다. 아무것도 기록되거나 전송되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TypeNote 需要监听您的按键以播放声音，\n任何内容都不会被记录或发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
